From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 13:56:29 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 172/202] Meridian: Mission Control shows every space's agents,
 by space, under their sessions' names

One Mission Control for the main profile and its spaces' profiles (a
Workbench in a space with its own profile reported to a Mission Control no
window showed). Each session shows under the name on its Workbench tab (the
session's name, or one given by hand) with the agent and model below, its
space and its context used; chips filter by space (remembered), all spaces
are grouped by space. Context Insights opens from a session's details. Every
agent in the Workbench shows (OpenCode and the others without live status).
A Workbench only takes its own terminals' numbers (terminal ids repeat across
Workbench tabs).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
